{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 1, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler a journey to the Land of the Rising Sun doth beckon! Attend now to this itinerary a chronicle of thy Japanese sojourn writ in the style of the Bard himself.\n\n**Day First Tokyo's Grand Entrance**\n\nFrom distant shores thou shalt arrive at Narita's gate\nA bustling city awaits a wondrous state.\nTo Shinjuku's heights thy chariot shall soar\nWhere neon lights do gleam and evermore\nA feast of ramen awaits thy eager tongue\nAnd vibrant streets with youthful spirits sung.\n\n**Day Second Imperial Majesty & Ancient Grace**\n\nTo Imperial Palace grounds we shall proceed\nWhere history doth whisper a noble creed.\nThen Asakusa's temple a sight to behold\nSenso-ji's grandeur stories yet untold.\nThrough Nakamise-dori's stalls thou shalt roam\nSeeking trinkets treasures a traveler's home.\n\n**Day Third Hakone's Mountainous Charm**\n\nHakone's valleys a painter's delight\nWith Mount Fuji's visage bathed in morning light.\nA cruise upon the lake a tranquil scene\nWhere nature's beauty reigns serene and keen.\nArt museums beckon a cultural grace\nA peaceful respite in this wondrous place.\n\n**Day Fourth Kyoto's Ancient Heart**\n\nBy bullet train swift we shall now convey\nTo Kyoto's splendor a brighter day.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermillion dream\nA thousand torii a sacred gleam.\nGion's district awaits geishas' art\nA timeless elegance a beating heart.\n\n**Day Fifth Golden Pavilion & Zen's Embrace**\n\nKinkaku-ji's gold a dazzling sight\nReflecting beauty in the morning light.\nRyoan-ji's garden a meditative space\nWhere stones and raked sand find their rightful place.\nPhilosopher's Path a stroll serene and slow\nWhere autumn leaves in fiery colors glow.\n\n**Day Sixth Nara's Deer & Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara we journey where deer freely roam\nA friendly greeting a welcoming home.\nTodai-ji Temple houses Buddha grand\nA testament to faith throughout the land.\nKasuga Taisha's lanterns softly shine\nA spiritual journey truly divine.\n\n**Day Seventh Osaka's Culinary Delights**\n\nOsaka's vibrant markets a foodie's quest\nTakoyaki and okonomiyaki truly blessed.\nDotonbori's lights a dazzling show\nWhere laughter echoes and spirits flow.\nOsaka Castle stands a proud display\nOf history's strength come what may.\n\n**Day Eighth Farewell Japan**\n\nWith heavy heart we bid this land adieu\nMemories cherished forever true.\nFrom bustling cities to temples old\nA tale of wonder bravely told.\nReturn to thy home with spirit bright\nAnd dreams of Japan bathed in golden light.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -1.4948062896728516}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.010484614409506321}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.2184155136346817}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.5871381163597107}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.02415303699672222}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -1.6418397426605225}, {"token": "▁Land", "logprob": -0.09470107406377792}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.0001776060671545565}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -7.629365427419543e-06}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁doth", "logprob": -0.8971139192581177}, {"token": "▁beck", "logprob": -0.605026125907898}, {"token": "on", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -1.4562501907348633}, {"token": "▁Attend", "logprob": -0.1372312754392624}, {"token": "▁now", "logprob": -0.6086863279342651}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.03423667699098587}, {"token": "▁this", "logprob": -0.010185761377215385}, {"token": "▁itinerary", "logprob": -0.03404727578163147}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -1.3353906869888306}, {"token": "▁chronicle", "logprob": -1.452430248260498}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.028613796457648277}, {"token": "▁thy", "logprob": -0.035425033420324326}, {"token": "▁Japanese", 